// Day 27: Confirm Entra ID audit logs are reaching Microsoft Sentinel
//
// What it looks for: policy-category operations in AuditLogs over the last day, such as
// Conditional Access policy changes.
//
// Why it matters: an attacker with admin rights can weaken a Conditional Access policy instead of
// fighting it. Policy edits are rare and high-value, so they are worth alerting on.
//
// Result in my lab (Oct 10, 2026): 1 row. "Update conditional access policy", Category Policy,
// Result success, from a policy edit I made to generate test telemetry.
AuditLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1d)
| where Category == "Policy"
| project TimeGenerated, OperationName, Category, Result
| sort by TimeGenerated desc
